{"license":"DANS Licence","fileAccessRequest":false,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Getuigen Verhalen, Dochters van 'foute' ouders, interview DNS05"},{"typeName":"alternativeTitle","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["Dochters van 'foute' ouders, oral history interview met DNS05"]},{"typeName":"alternativeURL","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"https:\/\/hdl.handle.net\/11653\/oral356"},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:41212"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Atria, kennisinstituut voor emancipatie en vrouwengeschiedenis"},"authorAffiliation":{"typeName":"authorAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"https:\/\/ror.org\/03n243a44","expandedvalue":{"scheme":"http:\/\/www.grid.ac\/ontology\/","@type":"https:\/\/schema.org\/Organization"}},"authorIdentifierScheme":{"typeName":"authorIdentifierScheme","multiple":false,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":"ISNI"},"authorIdentifier":{"typeName":"authorIdentifier","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"https:\/\/isni.org\/isni\/0000000121139771"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactAffiliation":{"typeName":"datasetContactAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Atria, kennisinstituut voor emancipaie en vrouwengeschiedenis"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>Oral history interview met een vrouw (1928) uit een arm Nederlands-Hervormd gezin, waarvan beide ouders in de jaren dertig NSB-lid worden. Tijdens de oorlog meldt de vader zich bij de Waffen-SS. DNS05 wordt lid van de Jeugdstorm. In 1943 vertrekt ze voor de Germaanse Landdienst naar Polen. Op Dolle Dinsdag vlucht ze met haar hoogzwangere moeder en broertjes en zusjes naar Duitsland. Halverwege de reis bevalt moeder van haar zevende kind. DNS05 reist met haar broertjes en zusjes door naar Osnabrück. Vervolgens moet ze op de vlucht voor de Russen tot ze wordt bevrijd door de Engelsen. Ze wordt intussen geconfronteerd met stromen vrijgelatenen uit de (concentratie)kampen. Terug in Nederland wordt ze in een kindertehuis in Noordwijk ondergebracht. Na de vrijlating van haar moeder volgt ze een deel van een psychiatrische verpleegstersopleiding, maar ze wordt overspannen. Pas als haar kinderen volwassen zijn, krijg ze haar zelfvertrouwen terug.<br>De aanleiding voor dit interview is het Aletta project om levensverhalen van vrouwen vast te leggen van wie de ouders tijdens WO II de kant van de bezetter kozen en zelf geïnterneerd en\/of in kindertehuizen en\/of in pleeggezinnen ondergebracht werden tijdens de internering van hun ouder(s).<\/p>"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Arts and Humanities","Social Sciences"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"N.S.B."},"keywordTermURI":{"typeName":"keywordTermURI","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"https:\/\/data.niod.nl\/WO2_Thesaurus\/2244"},"keywordVocabulary":{"typeName":"keywordVocabulary","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"NSB"},"keywordVocabularyURI":{"typeName":"keywordVocabularyURI","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"https:\/\/digitaalerfgoed.poolparty.biz\/westerbork\/2910.html"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"vrouwen"},"keywordTermURI":{"typeName":"keywordTermURI","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"https:\/\/data.niod.nl\/WO2_Thesaurus\/2793.html"},"keywordVocabulary":{"typeName":"keywordVocabulary","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"vrouwen"},"keywordVocabularyURI":{"typeName":"keywordVocabularyURI","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"https:\/\/vrouwenthesaurus.org\/conceptid\/1000783.html"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"nationaal socialisme"},"keywordTermURI":{"typeName":"keywordTermURI","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"https:\/\/vrouwenthesaurus.org\/conceptid\/1001794"},"keywordVocabulary":{"typeName":"keywordVocabulary","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"nationaalsocialisme"},"keywordVocabularyURI":{"typeName":"keywordVocabularyURI","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"https:\/\/www.wikidata.org\/wiki\/Q7310"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"tweede wereldoorlog"},"keywordTermURI":{"typeName":"keywordTermURI","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"https:\/\/vrouwenthesaurus.org\/conceptid\/1000783.html"},"keywordVocabulary":{"typeName":"keywordVocabulary","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Tweede Wereldoorlog"},"keywordVocabularyURI":{"typeName":"keywordVocabularyURI","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"https:\/\/data.niod.nl\/WO2_Thesaurus\/5110.html"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"collaboratie"},"keywordTermURI":{"typeName":"keywordTermURI","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"https:\/\/www.wikidata.org\/wiki\/Q156744"},"keywordVocabulary":{"typeName":"keywordVocabulary","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"collaboratie"},"key